1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,019
Forms are how visitors become contacts.

2
00:00:03,019 --> 00:00:06,830
In this lesson, you'll build
a form, add conditional logic,

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:11,158
decide what happens when someone
submits it, and embed it anywhere.

4
00:00:11,158 --> 00:00:12,902
Then we'll look at surveys.

5
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,381
Go to Sites, then Forms.

6
00:00:15,381 --> 00:00:20,274
Here are Bloom's forms, with how many
submissions each one has received.

7
00:00:20,274 --> 00:00:25,303
The Analyze tab shows conversion rates,
and Submissions lists every entry.

8
00:00:25,303 --> 00:00:27,953
Let's open the Invisalign Enquiry form.

9
00:00:28,803 --> 00:00:30,602
The form builder has three parts.

10
00:00:30,602 --> 00:00:33,002
Fields on the left,
your form in the middle,

11
00:00:33,002 --> 00:00:36,328
and the settings for whichever
field you select on the right.

12
00:00:37,176 --> 00:00:39,963
Standard fields, like
name, phone and email,

13
00:00:39,963 --> 00:00:42,561
fill in the contact record automatically.

14
00:00:42,561 --> 00:00:47,565
Custom fields store anything else you
need, like which treatment someone wants.

15
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:52,823
Every answer is saved on the contact, so
you can filter and automate with it later.

16
00:00:53,674 --> 00:00:56,002
To add a field, click it in the list.

17
00:00:56,002 --> 00:01:00,093
We'll add a Radio question, then
give it a label and two options.

18
00:01:00,093 --> 00:01:04,624
Bloom wants to know whether Invisalign
enquirers have had braces before.

19
00:01:05,449 --> 00:01:08,889
That question only makes
sense for Invisalign leads.

20
00:01:08,889 --> 00:01:11,734
So open Options and
add a conditional rule.

21
00:01:11,734 --> 00:01:15,836
If the treatment is Invisalign,
then show the braces question.

22
00:01:15,836 --> 00:01:19,541
Everyone else never sees it,
which keeps the form short.

23
00:01:20,391 --> 00:01:23,386
Next, decide what happens
after someone submits.

24
00:01:23,386 --> 00:01:26,942
You can show a thank-you
message, or send them to a page.

25
00:01:26,942 --> 00:01:31,933
A dedicated thank-you page is great,
because you can track it as a conversion in

26
00:01:31,933 --> 00:01:32,993
your ad accounts.

27
00:01:33,842 --> 00:01:38,986
Switch on email notifications, so your
team knows the moment a lead arrives.

28
00:01:38,986 --> 00:01:42,912
To tag the contact, send a
text, or create an opportunity,

29
00:01:42,912 --> 00:01:46,229
build a workflow with the
Form Submitted trigger.

30
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:47,989
We cover that in Module 9.

31
00:01:48,841 --> 00:01:53,266
In Styles, match the form to your
brand: button colour, background, width,

32
00:01:53,266 --> 00:01:55,717
and whether labels show above each field.

33
00:01:55,717 --> 00:01:56,674
Then click Save.

34
00:01:58,148 --> 00:02:01,485
To use the form on another
website, click Integrate.

35
00:02:01,485 --> 00:02:06,684
Choose a layout, like inline or popup,
then copy the embed code and paste it into

36
00:02:06,684 --> 00:02:07,326
your site.

37
00:02:07,326 --> 00:02:10,535
There's also a direct link
you can share anywhere.

38
00:02:11,388 --> 00:02:14,818
On your Kyntlo funnels and
websites, you don't need any code.

39
00:02:14,818 --> 00:02:18,473
Just add a Form element in the
page builder and choose this form.

40
00:02:19,324 --> 00:02:22,940
Surveys work like forms, but
ask one question per slide.

41
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:26,555
They feel like a quick quiz,
so more people finish them.

42
00:02:26,555 --> 00:02:28,944
Here's Bloom's Smile Assessment Quiz.

43
00:02:29,795 --> 00:02:35,038
Each slide holds one or two questions, and
the progress bar shows how close people

44
00:02:35,038 --> 00:02:35,997
are to the end.

45
00:02:35,997 --> 00:02:39,514
Slide logic lets you jump
past slides that don't apply,

46
00:02:39,514 --> 00:02:42,263
or disqualify people
who aren't a good fit.

47
00:02:43,114 --> 00:02:44,195
Here's a pro tip.

48
00:02:44,195 --> 00:02:46,484
Every field you add costs you leads.

49
00:02:46,484 --> 00:02:50,999
Ask only for what you need to follow
up, usually name, phone and email,

50
00:02:50,999 --> 00:02:53,161
and collect everything else later.

51
00:02:54,017 --> 00:02:56,363
Your forms are ready to collect leads.

52
00:02:56,363 --> 00:03:01,056
Next, we'll connect your own domain,
so your pages live at your business web

53
00:03:01,056 --> 00:03:01,550
address.

54
00:03:01,550 --> 00:03:02,414
See you there.
